<title>USA: Poe &amp; Brown Inc buys Larry Breen &amp; Ass.</title>
<headline>Poe &amp; Brown Inc buys Larry Breen &amp; Ass.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Fla 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poe &amp; Brown Inc said on Thursday that it bought Larry Breen &amp; Associates of Maitland, Florida.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company said Poe &amp; Brown bought the assets of Larry Breen in a cash deal, but declined to give any details.</p>
<p>Poe &amp; Brown, a general insurance agency, said the acquisition came into effect on September 1.</p>
<p>It said it would combine the Larry Breen's staff and operations with its office in Orlando.</p>
</text>
